title: "QFT Image Compression: Two-Qubit Simulation and SpinQ NMR Demonstration (reproducibility code)"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction and verification code for a two-qubit Quantum Fourier Transform image-compression
  demonstration on a 2 x 2 grayscale image, with a comparison against SpinQ NMR hardware measurements
  and additional analysis over K, test images and random images.
